      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I like this idea. Epilepsy isn't always triggered by flashing or bright lights as there are different forms. The medical icon could also be useful for people who have heart problems, anxiety, or hearing difficulties. I have trouble hearing others as I am hard of hearing and it'd be nice to have a little notation that shows I'm not the best at it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
