      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b28d7576ec5d16bbac6c445|full_name}: Unfortunately, it is not uncommon for the villains to enter the VRChat, and feeling impunity, cause system failures of other participants of the game, just for fun. Are not you afraid that these people, seeing a person with a green cross, will deliberately begin to install shimmering avatars to cause him an attack of epilepsy? Just for fun, to see how he suffers. We need other ways of protection. For example, in addition to the Panic Mode, the Safe Mode can be entered, in which only reliable shaders will be used and visual special effects will be disabled.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
