      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "My sister has 4 seizures every week sometimes she can have them everyday, medications reasons ...  THE MOST IMPORTANT THING IS MAKE SURE HER HEAD IS NOT LOOKING UP !  SHE/HE CAN DROWN HIMSELF AND DIE !   Optimal position is sideways . It would be nice this very important Info is a notification to all the users around the person having a seizure.",
      "viewerReactions": null
