  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-09-12T03:53:16.216Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "We can never tell who has medical issues such as epilepsy or seizures or such, I commonly see people pull out colorful avatars and they had no idea in the room was someone who cant handle it. If users were able to have a medical icon of somesort on thier nametags, perhaps a little \"+\" (medical cross) or something right under thier nametag, we would be able to see who in the room to be careful around. In the settings menu perhaps have a button that players can click to put the icon on their name.\n(This idea could also be used for streamers, they press a button in the settings and a streaming icon will apear on thier name so others can see they are streaming. But Im pressing for the medical icon more)",
